<title>BOSNIA: Bosnia March industrial prices down 8.6 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Bosnia March industrial prices down 8.6 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Bureau of Bosnia's Moslem-Croat federation issued the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCER PRICES	MARCH    FEB   MARCH 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)		-8.6     -0.2  -8.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		 +5.8     +6.4  -9.6</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data cover 51 percent of Bosnia-Hercegovina territory. Data for remaining 49 percent are not available. -- Sarajevo newsroom, +387-71-663-864.</p>
</text>
